msgid "正在开发的游戏"
msgstr "Games in Development"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/index.md:1
msgid "游戏玩法"
msgstr "Gameplay"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/index.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;目前《灵数奇缘》初期策划的游戏玩法被称为`Game 0`。未来还会尝试设计和制作《灵数奇缘》IP下其它玩法的游戏。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Currently, the gameplay designed in the early stage of \"Luv Sense Digital\" is called `Game 0`. In the future, we will also try to design and produce games with other gameplay styles under the \"Luv Sense Digital\" IP."
